<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-National Steel cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-National Steel cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber cut its rating of National Steel Corp to neutral from buy, according to a source at the brokerage.</p>
<p>-- Shares slipped 1/2 to 12-1/2 in early trading.</p>
</text>
